      "difficulty_reason": "本组保留factorization balance/score descent及card_bound构造；按small/medium/large prime ranges估计初始score、用valuation与rough/smooth分解压至o(n)，结合Stirling从log(n!)转换为n-n/log n+o(n/log n)的balanced factor count。Solution_2只是把已构造因子配对成≤n²并调整常数，同组不另计。H3来自score改进与prime-range estimates的完整构造，不是Solution末尾Stirling代值或代码规模。",
